    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25cf The Worst Behind-the-Scenes Tale of a Phantom Bishoujo Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689990/extras/49aa31f2ece80ecee5ab0a9b1c7758ae.avif?t=1754979965\" width=422 height=368 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the end of the 20th century, a mysterious bishoujo game was canceled before release\u2014so obscure, almost no one knew it existed. Crude, tasteless, and undeniably trash-tier, most would call it a total disaster.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But one mystery remains: the existence of its data, sealed tight with high-level encryption far beyond its era.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Who created it, and why?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To uncover the buried truth, the player must strip away its digital locks\u2014through games of &quot;Yakyuken,&quot; a risqu\u00e9 twist on rock-paper-scissors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A unique system where game and novel parts alternate in turn.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Part\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689990/extras/9307faae7cdae6e8a1e1065bf80b4f61.avif?t=1754979965\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Novel Part</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689990/extras/f3a37aa2623b92ab2126b996740d404e.avif?t=1754979965\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A cheerful, frivolous gameplay section and a dark, heavy story section alternate\u2014gradually falling out of sync as the game progresses.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > From the cute characters in Tokimeki Strip Janken to the grim dev team members, the art and visuals capture the nostalgic charm of 1990s visual novels.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0A deceptively adorable presentation hides a deeply unsettling psychological horror experience.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Content Warning</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game contains depictions of violence, blood, psychological distress, sexual themes, and shocking scenes using live-action footage.</p>",
