ate\u2014gradually falling out of sync as the game progresses.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > From the cute characters in Tokimeki Strip Janken to the grim dev team members, the art and visuals capture the nostalgic charm of 1990s visual novels.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0A deceptively adorable presentation hides a deeply unsettling psychological horror experience.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Content Warning</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game contains depictions of violence, blood, psychological distress, sexual themes, and shocking scenes using live-action footage.</p>",
